  "description": "New vehicle cleaning facility utilising an existing operational facility. Installation of 2no. demountable canopies to provide acoustic screening for vehicle-cleaning operations (jet washing and hand finishing). Reconfiguration of existing hardstanding to improve the layout and operation of the vehicle-wash area. Upgrade of the existing drainage and water-recycling system. Relocation of an existing shipping container to provide staff welfare facilities. Replacement of the existing boundary fence alongside the vehicle-wash area.",
